#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:1
msgid "Plug and Play China, Shanghai"
msgstr "璞跃中国上海中心"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:4
msgid "璞跃中国上海中心"
msgstr "璞跃中国上海中心"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:6
msgid "Accelerator | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "加速器｜浦东新区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Software AI, Hardware AI, Mobility."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI软件、AI硬件、交通。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:10
msgid ""
"The operator lists its Yangtze River Delta innovation center at "
"Zhangjiang Guochuang Center. Corporate innovation, office space and "
"venture investment have different admission and commercial terms."
msgstr "运营方公布的长三角区域创新中心位于张江国创中心。企业创新项目、办公场地和风险投资各有申请条件及商业条款。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S011 <https://admin.pnpchina.com/about/office-space/>`_. Plug "
"and Play 中国—科技创新加速器与投资机构，专注创新生态服务和开放式创新."
msgstr "`资料来源 S011 <https://admin.pnpchina.com/about/office-space/>`_. Plug and Play 中国—科技创新加速器与投资机构，专注创新生态服务和开放式创新."

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:24
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.pnpchina.com/>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://www.pnpchina.com/>`_"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:26
msgid ""
"Published address: 2F, Building 1, Phase II, Zhangjiang Guochuang Center, "
"899 Dangui Road."
msgstr "公开地址：浦东新区丹桂路899号张江国创中心二期1幢2楼。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:28
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map point is approximate, based on the published street context; it is "
"not an entrance or navigation coordinate."
msgstr "地图根据公开街道信息标注大致位置，不用于确认入口或导航。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:37
msgid "Identify the corporate business owner and one measurable use case."
msgstr "找到企业业务负责人，明确可量化的应用需求。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:39
msgid ""
"Submit the product brief, pilot evidence and relevant technical "
"requirements."
msgstr "提交产品简介、试点结果及相关技术要求。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:41
msgid ""
"Confirm cohort availability or agree a scoped pilot, data rights and IP "
"terms."
msgstr "确认项目是否正在征集，或另行约定试点范围、数据权属和知识产权。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:43
msgid ""
"Review procurement, payment, acceptance and the production decision "
"separately."
msgstr "分别确认采购、付款、验收流程，以及转为正式部署的决策条件。"

#: ../../entities/plugplay.rst:45
msgid ":doc:`Pudong district route </districts/pudong>`"
msgstr ":doc:`浦东新区合作指南 </districts/pudong>`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
#~ "route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
#~ msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"
